                         "representation":  "Identity/version/state columns plus one canonical immutable snapshot JSON payload.",
                         "reason":  "FoodPhysicalOrderVersion contains nested quote, fulfillment-intent, reservation-request, capacity-requirement, line, price and money snapshots. One canonical payload preserves the exact validated FOOD-005E snapshot without creating unnecessary query surfaces. State/version remain indexed columns because lifecycle sequencing must be enforced durably.",
